[1m[38;5;231mWhich task changes should generate a notification?[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Status / completion (Recommended)
  [38;5;246mTask moves between open, in-progress, done. The highest-signal change and the one most people actually watch for.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Due date changed (Recommended)
  [38;5;246mDeadline moved earlier or later — changes your planning, hard to notice otherwise.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Assignee changed
  [38;5;246mOwnership handoff. High value in multi-user, meaningless while there's one user — include it if multi-user is likely.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Title / description edited
  [38;5;246mContent churn. Complete coverage, but this is the category that usually generates the noise people mute.[39m
